  {
    "knowledge_point": {
      "db_id": 17592186087866,
      "id": "7de671ee-7bba-54ce-bec2-d2d6f5569f4a",
      "title": "Writing First-Order Linear ODEs in Standard Form"
    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "25dce346-e08c-5eac-be4c-cf6e0ca1ed0d",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
      ":question/problem": "Write the following first-order linear ODE in standard form.\n\n$$\n3 \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} + 4 \\cos{(x )}=- 8 y \\sin{(x )} - 3\\,.\n$$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "A first-order linear ODE is in standard form if it is written as\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+P(x)y=Q(x).\n$$\n\nConverting the given equation to standard form, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{gathered}3 \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} + 4 \\cos{(x )}=- 8 y \\sin{(x )} - 3 \\\\ 3 \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} + 8 y \\sin{(x )}=- 4 \\cos{(x )} - 3 \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+\\underbrace{(\\frac{8 \\sin{(x )}}{3})}_{P(x)}y=\\underbrace{- \\frac{4 \\cos{(x )}}{3} - 1}_{Q(x)}\\end{gathered}\n$$\n\nNow, the equation is written in standard form with $P(x)=\\frac{8 \\sin{(x )}}{3}$ and $Q(x)=- \\frac{4 \\cos{(x )}}{3} - 1.$",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "cab0b198-b981-5171-8d5e-5389bc36bc39",
          ":answer-field/key": "selection",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/radio",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "081ad351-97f9-5009-bf1b-77112918a6f5",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} + \\frac{8 y \\sin{(x )}}{3}=- \\frac{4 \\cos{(x )}}{3} - 1"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "687b4338-8d61-5c6e-8fcb-99ad14e5e89c",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} + \\frac{2 y \\sin{(x )}}{3}=- \\frac{4 \\cos{(x )}}{3} - \\frac{2}{3}"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "e6aa447a-8099-5461-950c-9d4ff7770b66",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} + \\frac{y \\sin{(x )}}{3}=- \\frac{4 \\cos{(x )}}{3} - \\frac{1}{3}"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "766421f2-2588-5578-b36b-15849b81bc2d",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} + \\frac{5 y \\sin{(x )}}{3}=- \\frac{4 \\cos{(x )}}{3} - \\frac{4}{3}"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "4a6714b4-7c9b-5766-9700-f5d9c42aba34",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} + \\frac{4 y \\sin{(x )}}{3}=- \\frac{4 \\cos{(x )}}{3} - \\frac{5}{3}"
            }
          ],
          ":answer-field/correct": [
            ":answer/id",
            "081ad351-97f9-5009-bf1b-77112918a6f5"
          ]
        }
      ]
